WEBVTT

00:25.275 --> 00:28.820
<i>When I'm in trouble,
I wish upon the stars.</i>

00:29.779 --> 00:31.865
<i>That my dad won't disappear.</i>

00:32.365 --> 00:34.366
<i>That school lunches are tasty.</i>

00:34.367 --> 00:36.786
<i>That there's no bullying at school.</i>

00:37.662 --> 00:38.538
<i>But...</i>

00:39.748 --> 00:42.625
<i>what do I really want?</i>

00:56.514 --> 00:59.893
TAKOPI'S ORIGINAL SIN

01:54.239 --> 01:58.534
So the reason I came back to Earth
was to make Marina happy.

01:58.535 --> 02:00.954
Not to make Shizuka Kuze happy-pi.

02:01.579 --> 02:03.331
I have no idea what you're talking about!

02:05.208 --> 02:07.876
You're incredibly bad
at getting to the point.

02:07.877 --> 02:10.587
So let's look for Shizuka together.

02:10.588 --> 02:13.590
When I woke up, she was gone.

02:13.591 --> 02:15.093
Azuma too.

02:15.802 --> 02:17.220
I can't go.

02:20.056 --> 02:22.100
I can't.

02:24.769 --> 02:27.856
I can't see Kuze anymore.

02:29.274 --> 02:31.859
This is the last time I'll see you too.

02:31.860 --> 02:32.944
Pi?

02:33.444 --> 02:34.403
AZUMA CLINIC

02:34.404 --> 02:36.697
<i>My family is going through a hard time.</i>

02:36.698 --> 02:37.614
THE CLINIC IS TEMPORARILY CLOSED TODAY

02:37.615 --> 02:40.285
<i>My mom is bedridden from the shock.</i>

02:40.952 --> 02:43.370
<i>My dad's back,</i>

02:43.371 --> 02:46.166
<i>but I don't know
what will happen to the clinic.</i>

02:46.749 --> 02:49.043
I can't cause them any more trouble.

02:50.128 --> 02:51.670
I need to head straight home today too.

02:51.671 --> 02:53.756
- This is for you...
- Azuma.

02:54.549 --> 02:57.135
Why are you saying all this-pi?

02:57.760 --> 03:00.512
Don't go-pi. Please don't go-pi.

03:00.513 --> 03:03.223
I'll be very sad
if I can't see you anymore-pi.

03:03.224 --> 03:07.770
Didn't you have fun playing with me-pi?

03:10.899 --> 03:12.107
It was fun.

03:12.108 --> 03:13.985
Then why are you leaving-pi?

03:14.569 --> 03:16.987
Is it because I'm a stupid, bad kid?

03:16.988 --> 03:18.322
I don't understand-pi.

03:18.323 --> 03:19.990
I don't understand anything-pi.

03:19.991 --> 03:21.284
I told you...

03:22.285 --> 03:23.744
Why do I

03:23.745 --> 03:27.290
still want Shizuka to smile-pi?

03:28.499 --> 03:30.251
I don't know anymore-pi.

03:30.752 --> 03:34.339
Shizuka is a bad girl. She'll hurt me

03:34.839 --> 03:36.674
and make Marina sad.

03:37.759 --> 03:40.219
But she was nice enough to give me bread.

03:40.220 --> 03:43.013
It was fun playing with her.

03:43.014 --> 03:45.141
I don't get it-pi.

03:45.808 --> 03:49.437
How can a bad kid
be a good kid at the same time?

03:50.855 --> 03:52.690
It's obvious.

03:54.150 --> 03:57.069
There are good and bad sides to people.

03:57.070 --> 03:59.530
Don't you know that, stupid octopus?

04:00.782 --> 04:02.450
You're an idiot too.

04:04.285 --> 04:06.245
Kuze isn't that good either.

04:06.246 --> 04:08.206
She hardly ever does her homework.

04:09.207 --> 04:10.291
Me too...

04:11.834 --> 04:13.502
I'm the biggest idiot.

04:13.503 --> 04:15.379
Then... Then why are you...

04:15.380 --> 04:17.006
Even so...

04:18.925 --> 04:21.261
The three of us had fun playing together.

04:21.844 --> 04:25.764
I had never been
that excited to go to school.

04:25.765 --> 04:26.933
Because...

04:27.684 --> 04:29.434
we're friends!

04:29.435 --> 04:33.481
You're happy-go-lucky and dumb
and useless, but you're kind.

04:34.148 --> 04:36.441
I'm a useless, hopeless piece of trash.

04:36.442 --> 04:39.486
I can't do anything right,
but you said I'm amazing.

04:39.487 --> 04:40.946
Because you're so dumb,
I know you were telling the truth.

04:40.947 --> 04:42.573
At least I know that.

04:43.366 --> 04:47.662
That's why I came here to thank you!

04:48.830 --> 04:51.249
This is your gadget, right?

04:51.749 --> 04:53.709
Sorry, I took it without asking.

04:53.710 --> 04:54.669
I'll give it back to you.

04:55.503 --> 04:57.588
The time I spent with you was fun.

04:58.339 --> 05:01.217
But I really can't do this.

05:02.343 --> 05:04.929
It was my one-sided desire to help Kuze,

05:05.430 --> 05:07.140
but in the end, I couldn't do anything.

05:08.641 --> 05:12.937
Maybe the mistake
was thinking I could save her.

05:14.439 --> 05:16.566
Although it's all I can do...

05:17.525 --> 05:19.401
Azuma.

05:19.402 --> 05:21.153
I have to go.

05:21.154 --> 05:23.572
I just snuck out for a bit today.

05:23.573 --> 05:26.074
Well... Wait-pi.

05:26.075 --> 05:27.534
Um... I think...

05:27.535 --> 05:31.039
Your eyes are different from before-pi.

05:31.622 --> 05:36.460
Do humans' eyes change shape
as they get older-pi?

05:36.461 --> 05:38.128
He bought it for me

05:38.129 --> 05:39.964
with his last paycheck.

05:41.883 --> 05:43.801
Because he got fired
from his part-time job.

05:49.432 --> 05:52.727
Junya might not be able to go to college.

05:58.274 --> 06:00.151
Azuma?

06:06.157 --> 06:08.785
Hey, octopus, let me ask you something.

06:09.827 --> 06:13.830
Happy Planet has a gadget
that can turn back time, right?

06:13.831 --> 06:14.749
Pi?

06:16.000 --> 06:20.170
If... If you see me again next time,

06:20.171 --> 06:21.964
tell him this for me.

06:23.091 --> 06:25.551
"Try fighting with your big brother."

06:27.887 --> 06:30.348
Bye-bye, Takopi.

06:36.896 --> 06:39.232
Bye-bye, Azuma.

06:43.111 --> 06:47.073
Just trying to help her
was definitely a mistake.

06:54.205 --> 06:55.914
TWO GIRLS HAVE GONE MISSING IN TOKYO

06:55.915 --> 06:57.999
PARENTS' ANGUISHED CRIES:
"GIVE US BACK OUR DAUGHTERS!"

06:58.000 --> 06:59.960
WHAT'S THE TRUTH BEHIND THIS CASE?!

06:59.961 --> 07:02.171
YAMASHITA FAMILY SPIRITED AWAY CASE
TWO GIRLS FOUND - COMMUNITY RELIEVED

07:18.855 --> 07:20.189
I finally found you-pi.

07:20.773 --> 07:22.066
Shizuka!

07:36.164 --> 07:39.208
Shizuka, I want to talk to you.

07:40.293 --> 07:41.668
Out of my way.

07:41.669 --> 07:44.172
I'm going to the health center
to look for Chappy.

07:45.006 --> 07:47.884
I have to check the stomachs
of the people there.

07:48.468 --> 07:49.635
I won't move-pi.

07:50.303 --> 07:53.972
If you do that, the people
at the health center will be sad-pi.

07:53.973 --> 07:56.934
You shouldn't hurt other people-pi.

07:57.643 --> 08:01.021
I don't want you to do that-pi.

08:01.022 --> 08:03.607
I'm sad too-pi.

08:03.608 --> 08:06.526
If you do that, you'll be sad too-pi.

08:06.527 --> 08:08.487
You've been alone for so long-pi.

08:08.488 --> 08:10.614
I know it's hard for you-pi.

08:10.615 --> 08:12.200
So, Shizuka--

08:15.369 --> 08:17.205
So what am I supposed to do?

08:18.289 --> 08:21.875
When Dad looks at me as if I'm a stranger,

08:21.876 --> 08:23.669
what am I supposed to do?

08:24.462 --> 08:27.297
- Shizu--
- If he's no longer just my dad,

08:27.298 --> 08:28.883
what am I supposed to do?

08:30.092 --> 08:31.886
If someone tells me
I can't ride the ferry alone,

08:32.553 --> 08:34.012
- what am I supposed to do?
- Pi...

08:34.013 --> 08:36.890
- Shizuka, it hurts.
- There's no adult around me.

08:36.891 --> 08:39.017
If Mama doesn't come back,

08:39.018 --> 08:40.978
- Pi!
- ...what am I supposed to do?!

08:41.938 --> 08:43.855
If I lose the notebook,
what am I supposed to do?

08:43.856 --> 08:44.940
Pi.

08:44.941 --> 08:47.526
They say I stink.
Where exactly do I stink?

08:47.527 --> 08:49.694
Mom never told me.

08:49.695 --> 08:50.696
You tell me!

08:52.657 --> 08:55.408
- If I can't see Dad whenever I want,
- Pi...

08:55.409 --> 08:56.327
- what am I supposed to do?
- Pi...

08:57.203 --> 08:58.787
If no one comes to Class Observation Day,

08:58.788 --> 09:00.455
what am I supposed to do?

09:00.456 --> 09:02.165
If people say Chappy's barking is too loud

09:02.166 --> 09:04.709
and get mad at me,
what am I supposed to do?

09:04.710 --> 09:06.545
If they tell me to call my family,

09:06.546 --> 09:08.714
but there's no one at home,

09:10.174 --> 09:11.968
what am I supposed to do?

09:13.511 --> 09:16.681
Who am I supposed to tell all this to?

09:17.807 --> 09:21.518
No one gives a damn about me.

09:21.519 --> 09:26.983
Hey, all of this...

09:28.109 --> 09:30.610
what am I supposed to do?!

09:30.611 --> 09:33.281
You tell me!

09:34.907 --> 09:36.158
I don't know.

09:38.327 --> 09:40.705
Sorry, Shizuka.

09:41.205 --> 09:44.499
It's too difficult for me.
I don't know-pi.

09:44.500 --> 09:47.085
Are you kidding me? What does that mean?

09:47.086 --> 09:49.504
- Ow!
- You can't do anything.

09:49.505 --> 09:50.548
Don't touch me.

09:51.507 --> 09:54.050
It's a Happy Handshake-pi.

09:54.051 --> 09:55.511
What?

09:56.387 --> 09:57.470
I'm sorry.

09:57.471 --> 09:59.306
I'm sorry, Shizuka.

09:59.307 --> 10:02.058
I'm sorry I couldn't
do anything for you-pi.

10:02.059 --> 10:04.894
But all this time,
I just wanted to do something for you.

10:04.895 --> 10:06.313
I'm sorry-pi.

10:06.314 --> 10:10.651
I didn't understand how you felt at all.

10:11.777 --> 10:12.987
I'm sorry...

10:13.571 --> 10:16.699
I didn't listen to you-pi.

10:17.658 --> 10:20.745
I'm sorry I didn't try
to understand you-pi.

10:21.829 --> 10:23.079
Shizuka.

10:23.080 --> 10:25.333
I'm sorry I made you lonely-pi.

10:27.627 --> 10:31.881
Shut up...

10:32.381 --> 10:33.214
Shizuka.

10:33.215 --> 10:37.761
Saying that now won't bring Dad back.

10:37.762 --> 10:38.721
Pi...

10:40.139 --> 10:43.058
Mom also won't love me anymore.

10:43.059 --> 10:44.477
Shizuka...

10:45.019 --> 10:47.562
Chappy won't come back either.

10:47.563 --> 10:49.690
It's all over.

10:54.862 --> 10:56.530
Shizuka...

11:05.206 --> 11:07.958
I'm sorry, Shizuka.

11:12.588 --> 11:19.095
<i>Why do the tears</i>

11:22.765 --> 11:25.141
<i>Keep</i>

11:25.142 --> 11:30.648
<i>Pouring out?</i>

11:32.858 --> 11:39.740
<i>I'm searching</i>

11:41.117 --> 11:44.911
<i>For the voice</i>

11:44.912 --> 11:49.083
<i>Inside my heart</i>

11:49.708 --> 11:50.917
SUMMER BREAK: TOKYO BATTLE PLAN

11:50.918 --> 11:55.713
<i>Under the sky</i>

11:55.714 --> 12:00.969
<i>We've always known</i>

12:00.970 --> 12:03.180
<i>Carefree</i>

12:03.681 --> 12:05.724
<i>And light</i>

12:06.434 --> 12:11.397
<i>We smile at each other</i>

12:11.897 --> 12:16.193
<i>Thinking about</i>

12:16.694 --> 12:23.659
<i>Those gentle days</i>

12:31.834 --> 12:34.211
Shizuka, I'm so happy-pi.

12:35.212 --> 12:39.633
I can be with you like this, always.

12:41.802 --> 12:42.887
And then...

12:47.600 --> 12:48.767
And then,

12:49.685 --> 12:54.273
actually, there's a precious gadget
I've been saving just to show you.

12:55.691 --> 12:57.109
It's Happy Camera.

12:57.735 --> 13:01.029
If you take a picture with this
and let the camera read it,

13:01.030 --> 13:04.365
you can go back
to the moment you took it-pi.

13:04.366 --> 13:07.620
It's broken now,
so it doesn't move anymore.

13:10.039 --> 13:10.873
But...

13:12.333 --> 13:13.876
But, Shizuka...

13:15.085 --> 13:17.170
Actually, I remembered something.

13:17.171 --> 13:18.297
There's one thing

13:19.173 --> 13:21.884
that only I can do for you.

13:24.303 --> 13:25.137
Wait.

13:25.930 --> 13:27.181
My Happy Power.

13:27.890 --> 13:29.974
- Wait.
- If I sacrifice it...

13:29.975 --> 13:30.975
Wait.

13:30.976 --> 13:33.102
...I can use the camera one more time.

13:33.103 --> 13:36.065
Wait! Wait! Wait--

13:37.900 --> 13:39.693
If you're gone too, Takopi...

13:40.361 --> 13:41.444
Shizuka.

13:41.445 --> 13:46.324
I'll make you smile your brightest-pi.

13:46.325 --> 13:49.828
I was very happy to be with you-pi.

13:50.621 --> 13:54.666
But if you can't smile, it's no good-pi.

13:54.667 --> 13:58.337
I'll smile. I will.

14:05.886 --> 14:08.055
To you, the one I cherish the most,

14:08.722 --> 14:11.600
I hope you get what you really want.

14:12.893 --> 14:14.978
<i>Shizuka, thank you</i>

14:14.979 --> 14:16.981
<i>for playing with me.</i>

14:17.982 --> 14:20.442
<i>Thank you for being my friend.</i>

14:24.488 --> 14:27.825
Thank you for giving me bread back then.

14:29.076 --> 14:31.120
Thank you, Shizuka.

14:32.162 --> 14:33.080
Goodbye.

14:33.747 --> 14:37.543
- I'm sure you'll...
- Wait! Takopi!

14:47.428 --> 14:48.429
What?

14:51.932 --> 14:53.266
What was I doing?

14:53.267 --> 14:54.809
TAKOPI'S ORIGINAL SIN

14:54.810 --> 14:59.315
EPISODE 6: TO ALL OF YOU IN 2016

15:03.402 --> 15:05.194
<i>Shizuka...</i>

15:05.195 --> 15:06.738
<i>Wake up.</i>

15:06.739 --> 15:09.199
<i>You'll be late if you don't hurry-pi.</i>

15:09.992 --> 15:11.285
<i>Shizuka!</i>

15:13.704 --> 15:15.289
Okay.

15:16.123 --> 15:17.666
<i>Good morning, Shizuka.</i>

15:18.667 --> 15:20.752
<i>The weather is so nice today.</i>

15:20.753 --> 15:23.464
<i>A day like this is perfect for school-pi.</i>

15:24.465 --> 15:28.885
<i>"School" is where Shizuka
goes every day-pi.</i>

15:28.886 --> 15:29.802
DIE!

15:29.803 --> 15:31.304
<i>There's no way I can forget that-pi.</i>

15:31.305 --> 15:33.849
<i>Because you taught me that.</i>

15:34.433 --> 15:35.392
<i>And then...</i>

15:38.062 --> 15:39.730
Good morning, Parasite.

15:40.314 --> 15:42.190
- <i>This girl is Marina.</i>
- Hey, you useless trash

15:42.191 --> 15:44.025
- <i>She's talking to Shizuka</i>
- of a tax thief.

15:44.026 --> 15:45.401
- <i>again today-pi.</i>
- You're cutting social welfare.

15:45.402 --> 15:47.737
- <i>She's a bully, but actually...</i>
- Aren't you ashamed?

15:47.738 --> 15:51.240
By the way, you're not wearing
that chameleon plant today.

15:51.241 --> 15:54.578
Looks like the gutter girl
knows how dirty she is...

15:55.996 --> 15:58.248
Huh? Not today?

15:58.999 --> 15:59.916
Chameleon plant?

15:59.917 --> 16:01.084
Uh...

16:01.085 --> 16:02.794
Marina?

16:02.795 --> 16:05.255
So disgusting! You're trash!

16:06.382 --> 16:09.634
<i>Oh, right. I have
to talk about you too-pi.</i>

16:09.635 --> 16:11.511
<i>Azuma.</i>

16:11.512 --> 16:14.597
I had a fight
with my big brother yesterday.

16:14.598 --> 16:17.058
So you have a big brother?

16:17.059 --> 16:19.978
He's terrible at games,
but he hogs the console.

16:19.979 --> 16:22.523
I want to play PS4 too.

16:23.315 --> 16:25.609
You have a PS4 at home?

16:26.193 --> 16:27.819
- Yeah.
- Wow!

16:27.820 --> 16:28.945
That's nice!

16:28.946 --> 16:30.864
Let's play together next time.

16:33.158 --> 16:35.035
We're switching classrooms next.

16:35.661 --> 16:37.371
- That's right.
- Let's go.

16:38.372 --> 16:40.248
I didn't know you liked games.

16:40.249 --> 16:42.750
I want the new console too.

16:42.751 --> 16:44.544
I only have a controller at home.

16:44.545 --> 16:45.921
Why?

16:46.797 --> 16:48.090
My dad bought it.

16:48.674 --> 16:51.218
- Um...
- Let's go, Naoki.

16:59.643 --> 17:02.646
<i>Yes, you were always alone.</i>

17:05.983 --> 17:08.861
<i>And so were you.</i>

17:10.946 --> 17:13.781
Don't push it, Parasite!

17:13.782 --> 17:16.409
Because of you, Mom cries every day.

17:16.410 --> 17:18.245
Dad gets angry every day.

17:18.912 --> 17:20.621
It's all your fault.

17:20.622 --> 17:22.249
All of it...

17:23.917 --> 17:25.793
Give them back to me.

17:25.794 --> 17:27.588
Give me back my old Mama and Papa.

17:29.423 --> 17:31.008
Give me back my family!

17:33.552 --> 17:34.428
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

17:41.101 --> 17:42.978
- Marina--
- What is that?

17:45.147 --> 17:48.483
I don't know. Feels like a random drawing.

17:48.484 --> 17:50.359
Super gross.

17:50.360 --> 17:52.988
It's just trash. So disgusting.

17:53.822 --> 17:55.741
It looks stupid as hell.

17:56.325 --> 17:57.992
Like it can't do anything.

17:57.993 --> 17:59.535
Useless trash.

17:59.536 --> 18:00.995
It feels like useless trash.

18:00.996 --> 18:04.457
But looks like it's going to do something.

18:04.458 --> 18:07.001
Feels like it'll just keep following us.

18:07.002 --> 18:11.255
And talk to us non-stop.

18:11.256 --> 18:13.132
It won't go back at all.

18:13.133 --> 18:14.051
What an idiot.

18:14.635 --> 18:17.721
It's completely useless,
but it just keeps talking.

18:18.472 --> 18:19.472
Because...

18:19.473 --> 18:22.768
- Talking can bring happiness-pi.
- Talking can bring happiness-pi.

18:23.811 --> 18:27.314
<i>That's right.
That's the most important thing.</i>

18:29.733 --> 18:31.234
Why are you crying?

18:31.235 --> 18:32.193
Eww!

18:32.194 --> 18:33.736
You're the same.

18:33.737 --> 18:36.322
What? What's going on?

18:36.323 --> 18:37.741
I don't know.

18:41.537 --> 18:45.833
<i>I forgot the most important rule.</i>

18:48.001 --> 18:49.544
<i>I'm sorry, Mama.</i>

18:49.545 --> 18:51.797
<i>I couldn't talk
to you properly in the end.</i>

18:57.678 --> 19:00.555
<i>On the third planet
in the solar system, "Earth,"</i>

19:00.556 --> 19:03.517
<i>to all of you in 2016,</i>

19:05.352 --> 19:07.688
<i>there were so many things
I couldn't do for you.</i>

19:09.398 --> 19:11.941
<i>The family that walked away from you.</i>

19:11.942 --> 19:13.861
<i>The heart that will never return.</i>

19:15.112 --> 19:16.864
<i>Your mama, who won't look you
in the eye anymore.</i>

19:17.739 --> 19:19.867
<i>Your papa, who isn't just yours anymore.</i>

19:22.494 --> 19:24.453
<i>Even though I couldn't do anything,</i>

19:24.454 --> 19:26.123
<i>I still hope that you,</i>

19:26.957 --> 19:28.333
<i>you,</i>

19:28.959 --> 19:30.335
<i>and you,</i>

19:32.045 --> 19:34.298
<i>and "all of you" who aren't alone anymore,</i>

19:34.923 --> 19:37.050
<i>will grow up into happy adults.</i>

19:42.306 --> 19:43.557
Thank you.

19:45.017 --> 19:46.310
Bye-bye.

19:48.562 --> 19:50.189
What are you looking at?

19:52.065 --> 19:53.609
Nothing.

21:35.585 --> 21:36.961
You know what?

21:36.962 --> 21:38.296
Mama looked scary today.

21:38.297 --> 21:40.089
I'm going to get a cake on my way home.

21:40.090 --> 21:42.800
Your mom has always been scary.

21:42.801 --> 21:45.177
Whose fault do you think it is?

21:45.178 --> 21:47.514
Still better than your household.

21:49.391 --> 21:50.975
I want to buy eye shadow.

21:50.976 --> 21:52.769
Hey, listen to me.

21:53.937 --> 21:54.854
